  "section_notes": "S2 contains no sales stop: exceeding the 5% limit never requires a ban, so the Hearth 10 (6.2%) can stay on sale, which favours Northwind. S5 sets a permanent 8-per-100k mandatory recall with no transition, which would immediately capture the Ember 8 (9.9), disadvantaging Halcyon; S3's 6-year retrofit (vs. 3-year safe) also favours Northwind, while S4's 36-month suppression deadline favours Halcyon's cost position."
